00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.620
because Bigfoot is, as you guessed,

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.440
a monster truck racing game

00:03:47.440 --> 00:03:49.640
in which there are two different modes

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.580
or two different types of action,

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:53.200
monster truck action,

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.860
that is top-down racing

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.420
and side-scrolling racing.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.200
So you're controlling this monster truck

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:00.300
through various events.

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:03.320
The core gameplay involves competing in races

00:04:03.320 --> 00:04:05.460
and other challenges like car crushing,

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.420
hill climbs, and mud racing.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.280
The goal is to win races and events

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.120
to progress through the game's various stages,

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:12.360
earning points, money,

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.160
and upgrades for your truck.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.380
All points we'll get back to,

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.780
