00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.180
So the game alternates

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.760
between these top-down

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:37.480
and side-scrolling racing segments

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:38.820
